# Code owners for mcp-policy-server.
#
# Last matching pattern wins, so the high-blast-radius paths sit at the bottom.
# Pair this with required review on those paths, which is a branch protection
# setting and not visible in this file.

# Everything, unless a later rule overrides.
*                           @AndreBremer

# Release and CI machinery. A change here can disable every other gate in the
# repository, publish from an unverified tree, or widen a token's scope.
/.github/                   @AndreBremer
/.github/workflows/         @AndreBremer

# Toolchain and lint policy. Changes here silently alter what CI accepts.
/.oxlintrc.json             @AndreBremer
/.oxfmtrc.json              @AndreBremer
/lefthook.yml               @AndreBremer
/knip.jsonc                 @AndreBremer
/package.json               @AndreBremer
/package-lock.json          @AndreBremer
